Cobalt Strike DNS Beacon encodes data in subdomains (e.g., `a1b2c3d4.target.com`). Zeek detection:
```
event dns_request(c: connection, msg: dns_msg, query: string, qtype: count, qclass: count)
{
    if ( /^[a-zA-Z0-9]{8,}\.target\.com$/ in query )
    add c$http$mime_type="application/dns-exfil";
}
```

